# Recorded by binance-recorder@spot-alts-bookticker.service into /data/live/spot-alts-bookticker-YYYY-MM-DD.jsonl.gz
# The long tail (PLAN.md §16): every pair research/scan_spreads.py --top 100 listed on 2026-10-04, plus the
# USDT books that price the ones not quoted in USDT, plus ZECBTC/ZECUSDT. To refresh: re-run the scan, paste
# its two symbol lists here and in spot-alts-aggtrade.env, then re-run ops/bootstrap.sh.
